{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_66_handoff_66", "label": "HANDOFF-66 \u2014 chat 113 to chat 114", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Written from chat 113 for chat 114 over BUILD90 main and BUILD142 compendia; it records that chat 113 took the fuller of HANDOFF-65's two cuts so that docket 7's target, the Manski/Shannon site and \u00a729.8's self-citing cell fell in one movement."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_chat_113_unit_l8029_l8097", "label": "Chat 113 unit L8029\u2013L8097 (\u00a729.6\u2013\u00a729.8)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_01", "label": "15m-01 \u2014 a section restates the sentence its own cited chapter withdrew", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L126", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00a729.6 L8039 prints \u00a719.5's clause word for word and credits Chapter 19's analysis, while \u00a719.5.1 quotes it and rules both wrong with a table giving rho 3,3,2,0 \u2014 docket 23 at chapter scale."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_02", "label": "15m-02 \u2014 four owners of the cost-of-rigour framing, with no consistent reading", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Count word four, colon-list three, three framing-marked rows naming five works, L8066 making the book the fourth and L8085 saying four were found: every reading breaks one of the three sentences."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_03", "label": "15m-03 \u2014 a universal refuted by the table beneath it, over a partition never printed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L138", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No row is labelled mathematics or philosophy, so the claim cannot be checked except by reading each row, which is why it is the third statement-against-its-own-table in three chats."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_04", "label": "15m-04 \u2014 a cited figure that exists nowhere but its own citation (7/7)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The finding stands only because both resolvers were run and reported separately: under section_span the cited tokens appear and every one of them is the citing sentence itself."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_06", "label": "15m-06 \u2014 docket 7 resolved as a finding: the affine-invariance reason is at \u00a723.8.3 L6368", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L147", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_finding_15m_07", "label": "15m-07 \u2014 a four-author survey with no Appendix F entry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L147", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Habib, Nourine and Thierry have one site each in six volumes, L8096, with no Appendix F entry, while two works cited in the same sentence do have entries."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_66_sweep_class_withdrawn_figure", "label": "Sweep class: a section citing another for a figure the cited section later withdrew", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-66.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_a